<div class="home-container">
  <section class="hero-section">
    <div class="hero-overlay">
      <div class="hero-content">
<h1 class="hero-title">L'ordre parfait pour votre cave à vin</h1>
<p class="hero-subtitle">VOTRE PASSION, BIEN RÉPERTORIÉE</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <% if user_signed_in? %>
            <%= link_to "Voir mes caves", storages_path, class: "btn-primary" %>
          <% else %>
            <%= link_to "Commencer l'expérience", new_user_registration_path, class: "btn-primary" %>
          <% end %>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="features-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title">Comment ça marche</h2>
      <div class="features-grid">
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon-wrapper">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="80" height="80" viewBox="0 0 80 80" class="feature-icon-img" fill="none">
              <path d="M10 34L40 12L70 34" stroke="#4a1c1c" stroke-width="5.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              <path d="M16 30V66H64V30" stroke="#4a1c1c" stroke-width="5.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              <path d="M25 32H29V40C31.5 41.5 32.5 44 32.5 47V64H21.5V47C21.5 44 22.5 41.5 25 40V32Z" fill="#4a1c1c"/>
              <path d="M38 32H42V40C44.5 41.5 45.5 44 45.5 47V64H34.5V47C34.5 44 35.5 41.5 38 40V32Z" fill="#4a1c1c"/>
              <path d="M51 32H55V40C57.5 41.5 58.5 44 58.5 47V64H47.5V47C47.5 44 48.5 41.5 51 40V32Z" fill="#4a1c1c"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="feature-title">1. Créez vos stockages</h3>
          <p class="feature-description">Configurez vos espaces personnalisés, de la cave naturelle au petit cellier de cuisine.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon-wrapper">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="80" height="80" viewBox="0 0 80 80" class="feature-icon-img" fill="none">
              <defs>
                <mask id="bottle-plus-cutout">
                  <rect width="80" height="80" fill="white"/>
                  <rect x="38" y="40" width="28" height="24" rx="5" fill="black"/>
                </mask>
              </defs>
              <path d="M30 10H38V14H37V24C42 27 45 32 45 38V65C45 67.2 43.2 69 41 69H27C24.8 69 23 67.2 23 65V38C23 32 26 27 31 24V14H30V10Z" fill="#4a1c1c" mask="url(#bottle-plus-cutout)"/>
              <path d="M51 43V61M42 52H60" stroke="#4a1c1c" stroke-width="5.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="feature-title">2. Ajoutez vos vins</h3>
          <p class="feature-description">Répertoriez vos bouteilles précieuses avec leurs notes de dégustation et caractéristiques.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon-wrapper">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="80" height="80" viewBox="0 0 80 80" class="feature-icon-img" fill="none">
              <circle cx="34" cy="34" r="19" stroke="#4a1c1c" stroke-width="6.5"/>
              <path d="M48 48L65 65" stroke="#4a1c1c" stroke-width="9" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="feature-title">3. Explorez et Gérez</h3>
          <p class="feature-description">Visualisez vos emplacements en temps réel et sachez toujours quelle bouteille ouvrir.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card feature-card-sommelier">
          <div class="feature-icon-wrapper">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="80" height="80" viewBox="0 0 80 80" class="feature-icon-img" fill="none">
              <path d="M20 16H48L45.2 31C44.2 37.8 39.5 42 34 42C28.5 42 23.8 37.8 22.8 31L20 16Z" stroke="#4a1c1c" stroke-width="5.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              <path d="M22.5 27H45.5L45 31C44 37.5 39.5 41.5 34 41.5C28.5 41.5 24 37.5 23 31L22.5 27Z" fill="#4a1c1c"/>
              <path d="M34 42V64" stroke="#4a1c1c" stroke-width="5.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              <path d="M23 64H45" stroke="#4a1c1c" stroke-width="5.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              <path d="M58 12L60.6 19.4L68 22L60.6 24.6L58 32L55.4 24.6L48 22L55.4 19.4L58 12Z" fill="#4a1c1c"/>
              <path d="M59 36L60.3 39.7L64 41L60.3 42.3L59 46L57.7 42.3L54 41L57.7 39.7L59 36Z" fill="#4a1c1c"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="feature-title">4. Consultez le Sommelier IA</h3>
          <p class="feature-description">Indiquez votre plat ou votre occasion : notre intelligence artificielle sélectionne la bouteille idéale parmi vos caves.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="cta-container">
      <div class="cta-content">
        <div class="wine-glass-wrapper">
          <%= image_tag "wine.png", alt: "Wine", class: "wine-glass-img" %>
        </div>
        <div class="cta-text-wrapper">
          <p class="cta-quote">"Pour les vrais connaisseurs, chaque bouteille a une histoire."</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
